      "rationale": "This simplification rule asserts a definedness characterization for the pre-existing partial Val-to-Float cast; it is an additional mathematical fact, and Stage 1 does not first prove its exact statement in a module omitting the rule.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-97b32164f2b5a0f8a4f7d3358ad9ac8bcf9d1636304fa03d8f8eba850e64967e",
      "start_line": 54,
      "text": "  rule #Ceil({@V:Val}:>Float)\n    => ({ isFloat(@V) #Equals true } #And #Ceil(@V))\n    [simplification]"
    },
    {
      "attributes": [
