+| Obligation | Exact source rule | Mathematical content |
+|---:|---|---|
+| 1 | `rule-97b32164f2b5a0f8a4f7d3358ad9ac8bcf9d1636304fa03d8f8eba850e64967e` | partial projection is defined iff the value is Float |
